    %% Generated by scripts/generate-architecture-map.mjs from the import statements in src/ (tests and fixtures skipped). Do not edit by hand: run `node scripts/generate-architecture-map.mjs` to regenerate it. `--check` runs in npm run docs:check.
    %% Each box is a layer. Its members come from the sets in scripts/lib/module-boundaries.mjs and from the dirs that export a provider identity listed in the compiled catalog. A dir or root file neither names lands in UNMAPPED.
    %% Solid arrow: imports from the layer above to the one below. Dashed arrow: imports upward, a port or type defined above. Each label counts import statements.
    %% Every layer imports the pure core, 3548 imports in all (ADAPTERS->CORE 434, COMPOSITION->CORE 15, APPLICATION->CORE 1304, PROVIDERS->CORE 1627, UNMAPPED->CORE 168), drawn once as the bottom box instead of as arrows.
    %% Arrows under 10 imports are not drawn: COMPOSITION->UNMAPPED 9, UNMAPPED->ADAPTERS 3, UNMAPPED->COMPOSITION 3.
    ADAPTERS["CLI and MCP adapters<br/>cli/, cli.ts, main/, main.ts, server/<br/>parse a command or MCP call and return the result"]
    COMPOSITION["Composition<br/>composition/<br/>production factories construct fresh providers and bind them to the workflows"]
    APPLICATION["Shared application workflows<br/>application/<br/>CLI/MCP use cases, sessions and investigation records"]
    PROVIDERS["Provider adapters<br/>adb/, android/, apktool/, artifacts/, browser/, captures/, cutter/<br/>dotnet/, electron/, evm/, firmware/, flutter/, frida/, gdb/<br/>ghidra/, go/, gpu/, hopper/, ida/, il2cpp/, inspector/<br/>javascript/, jeb/, kuna/, model/, native/, objdump/, pcap/<br/>rizin/, rust/, signals/, sqlite/, wasm/<br/>each wraps one engine, runtime or file format"]
    UNMAPPED["Not yet mapped<br/>catalogIdentity.ts, cliBrowserContext.ts, cliBrowserScenarioCommands.ts, cliCommandNames.ts, cliEvidenceCommands.ts, cliJavaScriptRuntimeCommands.ts, cliJsonInput.ts<br/>cliLogging.ts, cliObservationOptions.ts, cliOutput.ts, config/, doctorRuntime.ts, evaluation/, filesystem/<br/>generatedPackageMetadata.ts, identity.ts, logger.ts, mcpDoctor.ts, mcpStartupPolicy.ts, process/, providers/<br/>recordedCatalogDigests.ts, reference/, serverIdentity.ts, windows/<br/>named by neither scripts/lib/module-boundaries.mjs nor the provider catalog"]
    CORE["Pure core: domain semantics and contracts<br/>contracts/, domain/<br/>imported by every layer, imports nothing above"]
    ADAPTERS -->|"70 imports"| COMPOSITION
    ADAPTERS -->|"339 imports"| APPLICATION
    ADAPTERS -->|"35 imports"| PROVIDERS
